<title>SPAIN: RALLYING-MCRAE WINS CATALUNYA RALLY.</title>
<headline>RALLYING-MCRAE WINS CATALUNYA RALLY.</headline>
<dateline>LLORET DE MAR, Spain 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's Colin</p>
<p>McRae, driving a Subaru, won the Catalunya Rally, the last round</p>
<p>of the World Championship on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
